  "contract": "After a cheap base policy completes, a deepest constant-action scan that reuses the prepared projection must constrain any shallower fallback when the deep turn-capable probe times out.",
  "summary": "The f2455 Hard-empty stop at the upper-left was an effect. At the earliest preserved consequential divergence f2416, the physical solver completed p12 in 11.373 ms total and selected up from a one-state advantage, but p16 uniquely preferred down and the fresh c16 frontier excluded up while retaining down, left, up-left, down-left, and down-right. A cold p16 alone measured about 11.8-15.8 ms and could not fit the synchronous deadline, whereas c16 reused the same already-prepared projection and was much cheaper. One current bullet plus the source-defined boss spawner is one-removal-minimal for the exact p12/p16 and c16 relation after removing the enemy body; the full artifact preserves live timing and route history.",
